#: src/class-settings-screen.php:120
msgid "Left off, deleting the plugin keeps everything. Deactivating never removes anything. Ticked, deleting the plugin removes everything it made here: Spots and their photos, organizations, missions, campaigns, programs, records of work, invitations, its settings, its roles, and its connection to packout.spot. The pages the setup made are yours and stay, and so do people’s accounts. This cannot be undone. Deleting the plugin does not tell packout.spot. To take your listings off packout.spot, disconnect first, under Pack-Out Spot, Connection."
